                <title><![CDATA[【Albums (lossless)】FLAC - Stephen Sanchez - LOVE, LOVE, LOVE [Qobuz Hi Res 24-Bit/48 kHz]]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/stephen-sanchez-love-love-love-qobuz-hi-res-24-bit-48-khz.299604/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					<img src="https://static.qobuz.com/images/covers/rl/x3/gzqszifc9x3rl_600.jpg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://static.qobuz.com/images/covers/rl/x3/gzqszifc9x3rl_600.jpg" style=""><br>
<br>
<b>Release date</b>: May 8th, 2026.<br>
<br>
"An unabashedly romantic and reverential homage to the sound of golden-oldies radio.<br>
<br>
Stephen Sanchez may call Nashville home, but his heart belongs to Motown. As the title of his second album strongly suggests, LOVE, LOVE, LOVE  is an unabashedly romantic and reverential homage to the sound of golden-oldies radio, setting his honeyed croon to the hop-along rhythms of The Vandellas (“IT MIGHT BE LOVE”), the brassy bonhomie of The Temptations (“SWEET LOVE”), and the dreamy grooves of Marvin Gaye circa What’s Going On (the title track).<br>
<br>
 But like Bruno Mars before him, Sanchez is a natural-born showman who delights in giving classic sounds a modern makeover, with the future-soul strutter “CHUCK THE MONEY” and the sweeping U2-esque anthem “DON’T LET ME GO” shaking off the ’60s-retro dressing for more contemporary alt-pop aesthetics."<br>
<br>
<b>Tracklist:</b><br>
01. IT MIGHT BE LOVE (3:06)<br>
02. SWEET LOVE (2:25)<br>
03. LOVE, LOVE, LOVE (4:02)<br>
04. HOME TO MOTHER (3:16)<br>
05. CHUCK THE MONEY (2:44)<br>
06. ALREADY GOT ME (2:18)<br>
07. OOO BABY (I LOVE YOU) (2:06)<br>
08. DANCE AWAY THE MUSIC (2:12)<br>
09. FORGETTING YOUR KISS (3:05)<br>
10. DON'T LET ME GO (2:48)<br>
11. YOU ARE SO BEAUTIFUL (3:44)<br>
